(7183634, 1101390, 117534, '<td valign="top">WOW... That light is uber fantastic!!!!  one tiny nitpick, the patch of light in the front middle on ground grabs my eye, probably need to grab it and take exp down or levels, I just edited a shot I took that had the same looking blow out, it was hard I ended up in curves, levels, exp, and sat before I got it looking semi normal with out the blow out.  Regardless of that I still am giving this a 9 it is a FANTASTIC capture!!!!!</td>', 'WOW... That light is uber fantastic!!!!  one tiny nitpick, the patch of light in the front middle on ground grabs my eye, probably need to grab it and take exp down or levels, I just edited a shot I took that had the same looking blow out, it was hard I ended up in curves, levels, exp, and sat before I got it looking semi normal with out the blow out.  Regardless of that I still am giving this a 9 it is a FANTASTIC capture!!!!!', '2014-03-01 20:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
