(7183812, 1104339, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is such an exceptional image, Alessandro.  The lighting is just superb, and the tones just so rich.  It''s an interesting image because it''s hard to judge scale. The stone blocks, with the chain holes in them, almost look like cardboard boxes. So this could easily be a toy.</td>', 'This is such an exceptional image, Alessandro.  The lighting is just superb, and the tones just so rich.  It''s an interesting image because it''s hard to judge scale. The stone blocks, with the chain holes in them, almost look like cardboard boxes. So this could easily be a toy.', '2014-03-01 23:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
