(7183838, 1104336, 76335, '<td valign="top">Can''t help but reward this heavily. Flowers must be the most painted and photographed things in existence, so anything that forces (or tricks) me into looking at one differently, is worthy. That invitation aside, this is an intriguing abstract study, a polymorphic figure until the eyes and brain start to agree. A ten for you.</td>', 'Can''t help but reward this heavily. Flowers must be the most painted and photographed things in existence, so anything that forces (or tricks) me into looking at one differently, is worthy. That invitation aside, this is an intriguing abstract study, a polymorphic figure until the eyes and brain start to agree. A ten for you.', '2014-03-01 23:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
