(7184011, 1104327, 76335, '<td valign="top">The lofty statement of your title doesn''t quite support the image'' there''s no bloodshed or anything here. Otherwise a good enough snap from a festival or reenactment, although my eye for juxtaposition can''t get past the two hats on your front-and-center subject.</td>', 'The lofty statement of your title doesn''t quite support the image'' there''s no bloodshed or anything here. Otherwise a good enough snap from a festival or reenactment, although my eye for juxtaposition can''t get past the two hats on your front-and-center subject.', '2014-03-02 12:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
