(7187440, 1103326, 103142, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t care for pregnancy shots. And I don''t know what I have against them, because it was so wonderful being pregnant.<br/> <br/>Just saying that, since I don''t know that I''ve ever rated one higher than a 6, just because they just don''t work for me.<br/> <br/>That being said: this one is truly fantastic! What incredible lighting and what an absolutely gorgeous shot!<br/> <br/>I wish you''d come out to Virginia and teach me lighting. :)</td>', 'I normally don''t care for pregnancy shots. And I don''t know what I have against them, because it was so wonderful being pregnant. Just saying that, since I don''t know that I''ve ever rated one higher than a 6, just because they just don''t work for me. That being said: this one is truly fantastic! What incredible lighting and what an absolutely gorgeous shot! I wish you''d come out to Virginia and teach me lighting. :)', '2014-03-08 10:14:19.000000', NULL, 0),
