(7187496, 1104374, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely outstanding. The purity of line &amp; tone is exquisite. Your cropping is spot-on (as SC I have seen the original). Very auspicious start to your DPC journey. Only suggestion: touch up the haloing around the bird''s tail in the reflection. Janine can show you how (or, she BETTER be able to anyway) :-)</td>', 'This is absolutely outstanding. The purity of line & tone is exquisite. Your cropping is spot-on (as SC I have seen the original). Very auspicious start to your DPC journey. Only suggestion: touch up the haloing around the bird''s tail in the reflection. Janine can show you how (or, she BETTER be able to anyway) :-)', '2014-03-08 12:11:41.000000', NULL, 0),
