(7187668, 1104374, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful capture.  I had this picked to make the front page ... at least I was close with you grabbing 5th place overall.  :-)  Thought this may have been Wendy''s (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=103142" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">vawendy</a>) at first as this is the type of shot that she''s been known to take.  If you''re not familiar with Wendy''s work, take a look (she''s Very good).<br/> <br/>Anyway ... just wanted to drop by and say congrats on a lovely photo and a well deserved finish.</td>', 'This is a wonderful capture.  I had this picked to make the front page ... at least I was close with you grabbing 5th place overall.  :-)  Thought this may have been Wendy''s ( vawendy) at first as this is the type of shot that she''s been known to take.  If you''re not familiar with Wendy''s work, take a look (she''s Very good). Anyway ... just wanted to drop by and say congrats on a lovely photo and a well deserved finish.', '2014-03-08 21:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
