(7187755, 1103517, 124190, '<td valign="top">I''m still utterly confused .....in a good way....is it mylar?   <br/> <br/>So....  I made custom shaped balloons for a festival once.....had rolls of mylar and cut the mylar material into all sorts of amorphic fun shapes, sealed the seams with a small iron, then filled then with helium....they lasted for weeks.<br/> <br/>Love this shot..... you sound like a fun spirited soul! <br/>I have an overwhelming desire to see a whole bunch of them bursting at once!<br/> <br/>I will help.  :-)</td>', 'I''m still utterly confused .....in a good way....is it mylar?    So....  I made custom shaped balloons for a festival once.....had rolls of mylar and cut the mylar material into all sorts of amorphic fun shapes, sealed the seams with a small iron, then filled then with helium....they lasted for weeks. Love this shot..... you sound like a fun spirited soul! I have an overwhelming desire to see a whole bunch of them bursting at once! I will help.  :-)', '2014-03-09 09:29:14.000000', NULL, 0),
