(7187965, 1104322, 65234, '<td valign="top">Didn''t vote in this month''s FS (I know, I''m apalled at myself, too), but I would have given this one a 10, easy.  It''s clearly a leopard in the wild and I know they''re elusive creatures, and it''s got eye contact and is sharp as a tack and tells a story.  I''d have been happy to get any recognizable shot of a wild leopard; to get one like this ... just remarkable.</td>', 'Didn''t vote in this month''s FS (I know, I''m apalled at myself, too), but I would have given this one a 10, easy.  It''s clearly a leopard in the wild and I know they''re elusive creatures, and it''s got eye contact and is sharp as a tack and tells a story.  I''d have been happy to get any recognizable shot of a wild leopard; to get one like this ... just remarkable.', '2014-03-09 19:59:54.000000', NULL, 0),
