(7188409, 1104409, 108580, '<td valign="top">Wonderful story telling image. Not easily done in that temperature with a "P&amp;S" (which the Lumix FZ200 clearly is not). Underrated image. 7 from me. (How good is that 25-600mm f/2.8?)</td>', 'Wonderful story telling image. Not easily done in that temperature with a "P&S" (which the Lumix FZ200 clearly is not). Underrated image. 7 from me. (How good is that 25-600mm f/2.8?)', '2014-03-10 16:46:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7188538, 1104374, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great bird shot. I would say that the halo on the tail in the shadow is noticeable, but to me, the branches interfering with the bird''s head is more troublesome. To quote Zack Arias, "head in a clean spot." It''s wildlife, so it may not have been possible, but right to the side to skirt this. Or, really, I think at least the bit going through the bird''s head could be cloned. This way, it would actually add to the composition. In any case, a nicely seen shot, the vignette works well, but the bird/branch beard is distracting.</td>', 'Great bird shot. I would say that the halo on the tail in the shadow is noticeable, but to me, the branches interfering with the bird''s head is more troublesome. To quote Zack Arias, "head in a clean spot." It''s wildlife, so it may not have been possible, but right to the side to skirt this. Or, really, I think at least the bit going through the bird''s head could be cloned. This way, it would actually add to the composition. In any case, a nicely seen shot, the vignette works well, but the bird/branch beard is distracting.', '2014-03-11 01:56:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(7188559, 1104374, 158219, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your awesome comments and very helpful suggestions!  I am excited to have joined the DPC family and learning more about taking and editing my photos!</td>', 'Thank you all for your awesome comments and very helpful suggestions!  I am excited to have joined the DPC family and learning more about taking and editing my photos!', '2014-03-11 06:46:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7188569, 1103517, 153814, '<td valign="top">I was one of your 10''s this shot is just amazing.<br/>I tried something very similar with some water ballons and a go-pro shooting<br/>30 fps. I didn''t get anything as cool as this.<br/>Fantastic job!</td>', 'I was one of your 10''s this shot is just amazing.I tried something very similar with some water ballons and a go-pro shooting30 fps. I didn''t get anything as cool as this.Fantastic job!', '2014-03-11 07:25:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(7188617, 1104374, 104230, '<td valign="top">Welcome to DPC. Congratulations on the great finish in a FS.<br/> <br/>I love the negative space and the stillness you have captures with this image. I agree with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=93565" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">spiritualspatula</a> that a bit of cloning on the branch near the bird''s head would have added a bit to the composition. Looking forward to more of your submissions.<br/></td>', 'Welcome to DPC. Congratulations on the great finish in a FS. I love the negative space and the stillness you have captures with this image. I agree with  spiritualspatula that a bit of cloning on the branch near the bird''s head would have added a bit to the composition. Looking forward to more of your submissions.', '2014-03-11 12:34:43.000000', NULL, 0),
